# The Humanities Amidst the Bureaucratic Realities.

**Authors:** Terrey, John

## Abstract
Examines the prospects for the humanities within the bureaucratic structure which determines resource allocations. Suggests that higher education be viewed as big business to help clarify ways in which change, policy, and individuals interact within complex settings. Concludes that leadership is needed to sustain the role of the humanities within the bureaucracy. (AYC)

